WEBVTT

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:23.680
Iden: Welcome back, Agent Meeko. The Admiral needs us to extract an Imperial ally on my home world of Vardos. The target is Protectorate Gleb, a local official who once mentored both Agent Hask and myself. I don't know how this connects to Operation: Cinder, but I have to trust the Admiral. Make the jump to Vardos.

00:00:45.520 --> 00:00:49.900
Del: That's the **Dauntless**, the ship we rescued on Fondor. Why’s it here?

00:00:50.620 --> 00:01:01.320
Hask: Well, it's delivering cargo. It was carrying those satellites. Moff Raythe said they were needed for Operation: Cinder, but he wouldn’t tell us the target.

00:01:02.780 --> 00:01:06.040
Iden: Neither would the Admiral. Now I know why.

00:01:20.620 --> 00:01:21.460
Officer: The satellites are aligned, sir.

00:01:21.460 --> 00:01:22.460
Garrick: Excellent.

00:01:26.800 --> 00:01:28.620
Garrick: I did not call for you, Commander Versio.

00:01:28.620 --> 00:01:29.980
Iden: Vardos is our target?

00:01:29.980 --> 00:01:30.720
Garrick: One of them, yes.

00:01:30.720 --> 00:01:35.960
Iden: Why? The entire planet and its people, they're- they're loyal to the Empire!

00:01:36.280 --> 00:01:44.240
Garrick: The Emperor commands it. We will purge this planet and others. Fear shall spread, and the galaxy will remember who is in control.

00:01:45.080 --> 00:01:46.220
Iden: This is our home!

00:01:46.220 --> 00:01:50.520
Garrick: The Empire is our home! And we will do as the Emperor commands.

00:01:53.660 --> 00:01:55.320
Iden: I don’t take orders from dead men.

00:01:55.320 --> 00:01:58.080
Garrick: You take orders from me!

00:02:02.920 --> 00:02:04.860
Garrick: Activate the satellites. Now.

00:02:16.660 --> 00:02:25.400
Garrick: Leave for Vardos immediately. Recover Protectorate Gleb. She is your only target. That is all.

00:02:34.100 --> 00:02:36.800
Garrick: That. Is. All.

00:02:52.240 --> 00:02:58.700
Garrick: Contact Agent Hask on the **Corvus**. Tell him I need to speak to him, immediately.
